The single bet calculator follows a standardised workflow that mirrors the actual betting process. Each field corresponds to a specific element of the wager: the stake represents the amount placed, the odds format determines how odds are displayed and interpreted, and the odds value reflects the bookmaker's assessment. The calculator processes these inputs to show both total return (stake plus winnings) and net profit (winnings only).
